option.CLOUD_STYLE=Cloud style
option.CLOUD_STYLE.comment=Realistic: soft volumes with internal lighting. Enhanced Vanilla: block-shaped clouds with volume, shaded faces and layered tops. Both use the altitude, coverage and wind settings below.
value.CLOUD_STYLE.0=Off
value.CLOUD_STYLE.1=Realistic
value.CLOUD_STYLE.2=Enhanced Vanilla
