option.RAIN_OPACITY=Rain and snow visibility
option.RAIN_OPACITY.comment=Soft precipitation with skylight and torch lighting. Lower values keep the landscape clearer.
option.UNDERWATER_DENSITY=Underwater fog
option.UNDERWATER_DENSITY.comment=Gradual color absorption over distance. Lower values make the water clearer.
option.WATER_CAUSTICS=Underwater caustics
option.WATER_CAUSTICS.comment=Animated light on terrain below the submerged player, in areas lit by the sky.
option.UNDERWATER_DISTORTION=Underwater distortion
option.UNDERWATER_DISTORTION.comment=Gentle view ripples when submerged. Zero disables the effect.

option.UNDERWATER_RAYS=Underwater light shafts
option.UNDERWATER_RAYS.comment=Animated sunlight shafts when submerged, occluded by block shadows. Fade in rain and disappear at night. Zero disables them.
option.UNDERWATER_RAY_STEPS=Underwater shaft quality
option.UNDERWATER_RAY_STEPS.comment=More samples smooth shafts and shadows, at a higher performance cost while submerged.

option.END_PINK_LIGHT=End pink light intensity
option.END_PINK_LIGHT.comment=1.0 gives ambient light a vivid pink tint. 0.0 restores the previous soft pink. Intermediate values blend both colors.
value.END_PINK_LIGHT.0.0=Soft
value.END_PINK_LIGHT.1.0=Vivid pink

option.SUN_RAYS=Sunlight shafts
option.SUN_RAYS.comment=Volumetric sunlight shafts occluded by block shadows. Fade in rain and disappear at night. Zero disables them.
option.SUN_RAY_STEPS=Sunlight shaft quality
option.SUN_RAY_STEPS.comment=More samples smooth shafts at a higher performance cost. Shafts are calculated at half resolution.
